37. ТЕСТ FIREWALL
============================================================

Для разрешённого соединения:
ALLOW TEST

Для запрещённого:
DENY TEST


Примеры:

WIN-ARM -> WIN-KSC 13000:
ALLOW

WIN-ARM -> RED-WEB 443:
ALLOW

vpn-user -> RED-WEB 443:
ALLOW

vpn-user -> WIN-DC:
DENY

vpn-user -> WIN-KSC:
DENY

DMZ -> USER:
DENY

RED-OBS -> USER SSH:
DENY


Проверять конкретные порты.


============================================================
38. УНИВЕРСАЛЬНАЯ КОМАНДА WINDOWS
============================================================

Test-NetConnection <IP> -Port <PORT>


Примеры:

Test-NetConnection 10.10.20.10 -Port 443
Test-NetConnection 10.10.30.15 -Port 13000
Test-NetConnection 10.10.30.15 -Port 8061
Test-NetConnection 10.10.30.30 -Port 1514
Test-NetConnection 10.10.30.10 -Port 53


Результат:

TcpTestSucceeded : True

или:

TcpTestSucceeded : False


============================================================
39. УНИВЕРСАЛЬНЫЕ LINUX КОМАНДЫ
============================================================

ip -br a
ip route
ss -lntup
systemctl status <service>
journalctl -u <service> --no-pager -n 100
curl -vk https://<IP>
nc -vz <IP> <PORT>
timedatectl


============================================================
40. ЕСЛИ ЧТО-ТО НЕ РАБОТАЕТ
============================================================

Проверять снизу вверх:

1. Интерфейс
2. IP
3. Маска
4. Gateway
5. Route
6. DNS
7. Firewall
8. Listening service
9. Application
10. Authentication
11. Monitoring


Пример WIN-ARM -> WIN-KSC:13000:

1. WIN-ARM IP
2. WIN-KSC IP
3. route
4. firewall FW01
5. Windows Firewall
6. KSC service
7. Network Agent
8. KSC registration


============================================================
41. ПОИСК ПРОБЛЕМЫ KSC
============================================================

Если WIN-ARM offline:

1. IP
2. DNS
3. gateway
4. ping WIN-KSC
5. TCP 13000
6. Network Agent
7. KSC Server
8. регистрация
9. policy
10. дата/время


Windows:

Get-Service | Where-Object {
    $_.Name -match "klnagent|Kaspersky"
}


============================================================
42. ПОИСК ПРОБЛЕМЫ WAZUH
============================================================

Если агент offline:

1. IP
2. route
3. TCP 1514
4. agent service
5. manager
6. registration
7. время
8. firewall


WIN-ARM:

Test-NetConnection 10.10.30.30 -Port 1514


WAZUH:

ss -lntup | grep 1514


Windows:

Get-Service WazuhSvc

Get-WinEvent -LogName Application -MaxEvents 50


============================================================
43. ПОИСК ПРОБЛЕМЫ PROMETHEUS
============================================================

Если target DOWN:

1. IP
2. route
3. firewall
4. exporter
5. listening port
6. Prometheus config
7. target address


curl http://<TARGET>:9100/metrics

или:

curl http://<TARGET>:9182/metrics


Если curl работает,
но Prometheus показывает DOWN:

проверить target config,
DNS,
firewall,
timeout.


============================================================
44. ФИНАЛЬНАЯ ПРОВЕРКА
============================================================

FW01:

[ ] нет лишних ALLOW
[ ] нет ненужных открытых портов
[ ] NAT работает
[ ] VPN работает
[ ] CRL работает
[ ] IPS prevention


WIN-DC:

[ ] AD
[ ] DNS
[ ] NTP
[ ] password policy
[ ] auditor


WIN-KSC:

[ ] WIN-ARM online
[ ] correct group
[ ] baseline policy
[ ] KES active
[ ] auditor read-only


WIN-ARM:

[ ] domain
[ ] KES
[ ] Wazuh
[ ] USB policy
[ ] isolation tested


RED-WEB:

[ ] nginx
[ ] HTTPS
[ ] Wazuh
[ ] monitoring


WAZUH:

[ ] FIM
[ ] correlation
[ ] agent
[ ] alerts


RED-OBS:

[ ] Prometheus
[ ] exporters
[ ] Loki
[ ] Alloy
[ ] Grafana


VPN:

[ ] user
[ ] admin
[ ] revoked


